#: bfa43bddf34b4637a8045df468687c35
msgid ""
"For normal GPS only operation, ArduPilot’s GPS parameter defaults will work "
"for any serial port configured for ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 5. To set up "
"simpleRTK3B Pro receiver to use with ArduPilot, we have prepared several "
"tutorials:"
msgstr ""
"对于普通仅 GPS 操作，ArduPilot 的 GPS 参数默认值适用于任何配置为 ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 5 的串口。如需将 "
"simpleRTK3B Pro 接收机与 ArduPilot 配合使用，我们准备了以下几篇教程："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ardusimple-rtk-gps-simplertk3b-pro.rst:60
